  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ego Ugolinus de Forteguerris, pro remedio animae meae et ob fidelitatem servitiorum quae mihi praestiterunt, manumitto et liberos facio Petrum, Mariam et Luciam, familiam meam, ab omni vinculo servitutis, ut deinceps vivant in libertate plena et nullus eos possit reclamare ut servos vel ancillas.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis contra hanc meam cartam libertatis venire temptaverit, iram Dei omnipotentis incurrat et solvat poenam florenorum aureorum triginta.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness><name>Scottus de Scottis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Ranerius de Malavoltis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Guidottus de Pagliaresis</name></witness>
        <witness><name>Matthaeus de Tolomeis</name></witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
  </text>
